{
  "info": {
    "name": "ISO Docs API",
    "_postman_id": "2c59889e-3054-47a7-828c-18438b37a1a9",
    "description": "ISO 文件管理系統後端 API。契約見 backend/docs/api.md。\n\n用法：\n1. 匯入本集合與 ISO-Docs-API.postman_environment.json，環境切到「ISO Docs — Local」。\n2. Settings 關閉 SSL certificate verification（本機自簽憑證）。\n3. 先跑 Auth > Login（填 empno / password 環境變數）。\n4. 非 GET 請求會由 collection pre-request script 自動從 cookie jar 取 isodocs.xsrf 塞進 X-XSRF-TOKEN。\n5. Login / Create 類請求的 test script 會把 id 寫回環境變數供後續使用。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [{ "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://localhost:7167" }],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// 非 GET 請求：自動帶 CSRF token（讀 isodocs.xsrf cookie -> X-XSRF-TOKEN header）",
          "const method = (pm.request.method || 'GET').toUpperCase();",
          "if (['GET', 'HEAD', 'OPTIONS', 'TRACE'].indexOf(method) === -1) {",
          "  const baseUrl = pm.environment.get('baseUrl') || pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl') || 'https://localhost:7167';",
          "  try {",
          "    const jar = pm.cookiejar();",
          "    jar.get(baseUrl, 'isodocs.xsrf', function (err, value) {",
          "      if (!err && value) {",
          "        pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-XSRF-TOKEN', value: value });",
          "        pm.environment.set('xsrfToken', value);",
          "      }",
          "    });",
          "  } catch (e) {",
          "    const t = pm.environment.get('xsrfToken');",
          "    if (t) { pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-XSRF-TOKEN', value: t }); }",
          "  }",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (b.companyId) pm.environment.set('companyId', b.companyId);",
                  "  if (b.userId) pm.environment.set('currentUserId', b.userId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"empno\": \"{{empno}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "匿名，不需 X-XSRF-TOKEN。200 -> { userId, name, role, companyId, companyName, deptName }，並種下 isodocs.auth / isodocs.xsrf cookie。400 欄位缺；401 帳密錯誤。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User (me)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (b.companyId) pm.environment.set('companyId', b.companyId);",
                  "  if (b.deptId) pm.environment.set('deptId', b.deptId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "已登入。200 -> MeResponse（含 role / companyId / companyName / deptId / deptName / mustChangePassword）。刷新 isodocs.xsrf。401 未登入。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NewPass123\",\n  \"newPasswordConfirmation\": \"NewPass123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "change-password"]
            },
            "description": "已登入 + CSRF。三欄必填；兩次新密碼一致；新密碼 != 目前密碼。204 成功。400 ValidationProblemDetails（errors.currentPassword / newPassword ...），密碼錯誤是 400 不是 401。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "已登入 + CSRF。無 body。204 清除認證 cookie。401 未登入。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Antiforgery",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get CSRF Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));",
                  "try {",
                  "  const jar = pm.cookiejar();",
                  "  jar.get(pm.environment.get('baseUrl') || pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl'), 'isodocs.xsrf', function (err, value) {",
                  "    if (!err && value) pm.environment.set('xsrfToken', value);",
                  "  });",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/antiforgery/token",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "antiforgery", "token"]
            },
            "description": "匿名。204，Set-Cookie: isodocs.xsrf。送出非 GET 請求前用來確保有 token。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
